    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Embed standardized morphology and fertility of domestic races and closely allied wild species in the same multivariate trait space. Compare effect sizes and directions of divergence; similar axes but usually smaller race distances support the claim.";
